# Naming

- Entry: `/poteto-mode`. Do not enumerate `/how` then `/architect` then `/arena` unless asked.
- Product eyes: `verify-<app>` + `control-<app>` CLI. Kitchen uses `verify-factory` only.
- Feature Map: kebab file names and sub-feature IDs.
- Commits/PRs: Conventional Commits `type(scope): subject`. PR body: Why, Scope, Tradeoffs, Blast Radius, Verification.
- Architecture: **Dune** (method only — never claim third-party Electron source). Product file: `.cursor/dune.md`.
- Slack line: Benny (fail closed until Slack is real). Outer loop: Grok Bot routines.
- Keep upstream skill names; our product nouns are ours — see `docs/naming.md`. Storage: `docs/storage-layout.md`.
- Prose: this kitchen is **inspired by** public pstack / agent-factory talks. Do not name-drop authors in commits, comments, or PR bodies unless citing a specific public URL in Sources.
